@startuml
title Download Track
actor User
participant UI
participant DownloadWorker
participant FastAPI
participant Filesystem
database SQLite

User -> UI : click Download
UI -> DownloadWorker : start in QThread
DownloadWorker -> FastAPI : GET /tracks/{id}/download
FastAPI -> Filesystem : stream audio
Filesystem --> FastAPI : bytes
FastAPI --> DownloadWorker : response stream
DownloadWorker -> DownloadWorker : write .part, atomic rename
DownloadWorker --> UI : success(track, path)
UI -> SQLite : insert local track
@enduml
